            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.86</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Choose your addy.land username during onboarding. A new &quot;Choose a Username&quot; step comes right after sign-in, prefilled with the handle your account got automatically. Pressing Next saves any change.</li>
<li>A new Settings → Account page shows who is signed in and lets you change your addy.land username. It also has a &quot;Manage Account on addy.land&quot; button and a Sign Out button that asks for confirmation first.</li>
<li>The username field gives live feedback as you type. It lowercases your entry, strips a leading &quot;@&quot;, and flags invalid characters or lengths right away (1–24 characters, lowercase letters, numbers and hyphens, no leading or trailing hyphen). After a short pause it checks with addy.land whether the name is available. If addy.land refuses a save, you see its reason.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Closing the setup window no longer quits Addy just because you haven&#x27;t finished the username step. Only signing in is required.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
